    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Straight from the '90s, 90FX brings back the thrill and raw energy of early revolutionary racing games.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Staying true to its retro roots, the game features tight, precise steering and fast-paced action, enhanced with modern mechanics and fresh ideas inspired by newer titles.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569060/extras/e6f7cf05c8f2baa3e6e8caf10b578385.poster.avif?t=1749372988\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569060/extras/e6f7cf05c8f2baa3e6e8caf10b578385.webm?t=1749372988\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569060/extras/e6f7cf05c8f2baa3e6e8caf10b578385.mp4?t=1749372988\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With up to 40 vehicles battling for position\u2014and optionally armed with weapons\u2014there\u2019s never a dull moment. Even when you're in the lead, danger is always just ahead: mines, and chaos from those behind keep every race unpredictable. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From wild first-lap pileups to explosive shootouts\u2014or even the occasional laid-back cruise, 90FX offers something for every kind of racer. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A surprisingly competent and adaptive AI (still being fine-tuned during Early Access) will gladly leave you in the dust if you make a mistake, or take you out with a missile when you least expect it. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There\u2019s no rubberbanding here. Every crash, every overtaking move, every destroyed opponent truly matters. Success is all about skill and strategy. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569060/extras/a99872f84d0b5bf7a1f66cb9cd48ec5b.poster.avif?t=1749372988\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569060/extras/a99872f84d0b5bf7a1f66cb9cd48ec5b.webm?t=1749372988\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569060/extras/a99872f84d0b5bf7a1f66cb9cd48ec5b.mp4?t=1749372988\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And whether you\u2019re racing with a keyboard or gamepad, the controls are built to feel natural and responsive on both\u2014every track, every turn, every shortcut is designed with both inputs in mind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weapons follow the same design philosophy: intuitive and satisfying to use, with no friction between you and the fun of blowing up your rivals. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569060/extras/61e2e7812ff479c492b1687102ae5462.poster.avif?t=1749372988\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569060/extras/61e2e7812ff479c492b1687102ae5462.webm?t=1749372988\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569060/extras/61e2e7812ff479c492b1687102ae5462.mp4?t=1749372988\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Visually, 90FX embraces a stylized, abstract aesthetic\u2014colorful, shiny, and instantly readable, capturing not what the '90s actually looked like, but what they felt like.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > The game is designed to keep you fully in the moment, with clear and distinct visual cues for everything that matters on the track, all without sacrificing performance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>So, what are you waiting for? Jump into 90FX and experience the '90s all over again\u2014louder, faster, and more explosive than ever.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Straight from the '90s, 90FX brings back the thrill and raw energy of early revolutionary racing games.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Staying true to its retro roots, the game features tight, precise steering and fast-paced action, enhanced with modern mechanics and fresh ideas inspired by newer titles.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569060/extras/e6f7cf05c8f2baa3e6e8caf10b578385.poster.avif?t=1749372988\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569060/extras/e6f7cf05c8f2baa3e6e8caf10b578385.webm?t=1749372988\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569060/extras/e6f7cf05c8f2baa3e6e8caf10b578385.mp4?t=1749372988\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With up to 40 vehicles battling for position\u2014and optionally armed with weapons\u2014there\u2019s never a dull moment. Even when you're in the lead, danger is always just ahead: mines, and chaos from those behind keep every race unpredictable. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From wild first-lap pileups to explosive shootouts\u2014or even the occasional laid-back cruise, 90FX offers something for every kind of racer. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A surprisingly competent and adaptive AI (still being fine-tuned during Early Access) will gladly leave you in the dust if you make a mistake, or take you out with a missile when you least expect it. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There\u2019s no rubberbanding here. Every crash, every overtaking move, every destroyed opponent truly matters. Success is all about skill and strategy. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569060/extras/a99872f84d0b5bf7a1f66cb9cd48ec5b.poster.avif?t=1749372988\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569060/extras/a99872f84d0b5bf7a1f66cb9cd48ec5b.webm?t=1749372988\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569060/extras/a99872f84d0b5bf7a1f66cb9cd48ec5b.mp4?t=1749372988\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And whether you\u2019re racing with a keyboard or gamepad, the controls are built to feel natural and responsive on both\u2014every track, every turn, every shortcut is designed with both inputs in mind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weapons follow the same design philosophy: intuitive and satisfying to use, with no friction between you and the fun of blowing up your rivals. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569060/extras/61e2e7812ff479c492b1687102ae5462.poster.avif?t=1749372988\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569060/extras/61e2e7812ff479c492b1687102ae5462.webm?t=1749372988\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569060/extras/61e2e7812ff479c492b1687102ae5462.mp4?t=1749372988\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Visually, 90FX embraces a stylized, abstract aesthetic\u2014colorful, shiny, and instantly readable, capturing not what the '90s actually looked like, but what they felt like.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > The game is designed to keep you fully in the moment, with clear and distinct visual cues for everything that matters on the track, all without sacrificing performance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>So, what are you waiting for? Jump into 90FX and experience the '90s all over again\u2014louder, faster, and more explosive than ever.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
